This directory contains sources/binaries/etc of third party tools that are required.

This is not for big commonly used libraries, but will most certainly contain Eigen and similar things.

eigen3/ :
   This directory contains the sources of the Eigen template library. Current version is 3.0

Interfaces/:
   This directory will contain interface C++ header to libraries that require it. Currently it only contains a LAPACK interface.

rapidxml/:
   Rapid xml is a small xml library used for reading the parameter files. Current version is 1.13
